{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And you went, etc.</b> And behold, yet another evil: it was not enough that you served idolatry, but you sent a gift to the king of Assyria or to Egypt to lean upon him. Now ותשורי is like אשורנו; you went to see:" "<b>With oil.</b> For from the land of Israel they convey oil:" "<b>Your envoys.</b> They are the emissaries:" "<b>And you humbled.</b> Your soul, down to Sheol:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 57, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:59:56.411200410Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}